Hello, fellow lojbanists.

I am writing sometimes (quite rarely though) to maillist, but,
probably, it would be better if I introduce myself.

You can see my name, and , probably, you can guess that my native
language is Russian.

Lojban is one of my hobbies for a really long time (5 years, I
guess... or even more), but, due to various reasons, I am still le
citno jbopre. Well, that's all in general.

So what about the subject. Russian translations are practically not
present in jbovlaste, but there is almost complete standalone jbo-ru
dictionary, named saxaras (available at lojban.org).

What I want is to upload all these translations to jbovlaste. Long
time ago, I had an account, but, as far as I remember, entering
translations was really tedious process. I would better like to upload
all the data at once. Can anybody help me with it?

I have enough skills to convert saxaras dictionary file to virtually any format.

If it is not possible or undesirable for some reasons, just tell me
and I will start entering data manually.

mu'o


